	               "<fame_color>Heat</fame_color>   Rises over time and with each mission. Each of its {1} stages sends hunters.\n"\
	               "<fame_color>Cool</fame_color>   Each jump cuts heat: {2:0%} via a watched relay, {3:0%} via a clear relay, {4:0%} blind.\n"\
	               "<fame_color>Cargo</fame_color>  A destroyed Tech Vault drops its tech as crates. Lose it all and get none back in time, and the run ends.\n"\
